			class="text-ghost-white text-5xl text-center lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-2 overflow-hidden"
		>
			Want to know more about me?
		</p>
		<span class="text-ghost-white text-center lg:text-start"
			>You can add me on <a
				href="#"
				id="discord-link"
				data-sm="discord"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				class="font-medium text-ghost-white underline transition"
				>Discord</a
			> or follow me on <a
				href="#"
				id="instagram-link"
				data-sm="instagram"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				class="font-medium text-ghost-white underline transition"
				>Instagram</a
			>. We can talk, do pair programming or even play some games!</span
		>
